<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-SOCCER CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-SOCCER CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Estonian soccer</p>
<p>championship matches played on Saturday.</p>
<p> Lelle Sk	  - FC Flora     0:2</p>
<p> Narva Trans     - FC Lantana   1:2</p>
<p> Tallinna Sadam  - FC Marlekor  0:1</p>
<p>Standings:</p>
<p>			 P    W    D    L     F   A   Pts</p>
<p> 1. FC Lantana     3    3    0    0    11   1   27</p>
<p> 2. FC Flora	 4    3    1    0    10   2   25</p>
<p> 3. FC Marlekor    3    1    0    2     1   9   14</p>
<p> 4. Lelle SK	 4    1    0    3     1   9   14</p>
<p> 5. Narva Trans    3    1    0    2     2   2   10</p>
<p> 6. Tallinna Sadam 3    0    1    2     1   3    9</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
